D6 - SPACING AND INITIAL INTERFACE STYLES
=========================================

1. SPACING SCALE
----------------
Token      Value   Use
space-1    4px     Tiny gaps (icon to text)
space-2    8px     Label to input
space-3    12px    Between items in a card
space-4    16px    Card padding, mobile page margin
space-6    24px    Between cards
space-8    32px    Between sections


2. BORDER-RADIUS AND BORDERS
----------------------------
radius-sm   8px    Buttons, inputs
radius-md   12px   Cards
Card border:   1px #DCDCDC (color/border)
Input border:  1px #4F4F4F (color/text-secondary)
Secondary button border: 1.5px #141414 (color/text)


5. ANNOTATION
-------------
Every card uses 16px padding (space-4) and 12px between its items
(space-3), so all cards line up and feel the same across the site.